        {
          "insert": "assemble",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " whether empty and failed inputs are omitted, labeled, or rendered as an explicit limitation. Keep that policy local to the agent rather than assuming every loader succeeds."
